Third-party data notice

The MIT terms above cover the code, documentation, figures, articles, and the
underwriting experiment's generated data (the starter manual, the house rules,
the 38 application files and their answers under `data/underwriting/`), all of
which are original to this repository and entirely synthetic.

The claims experiments additionally reference the HLT-008 Synthetic Healthcare
Claims Dataset (Sample Preview), published by XpertSystems.ai at
https://huggingface.co/datasets/xpertsystems/hlt008-sample under
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 (CC BY-NC 4.0).

No file from that dataset is redistributed here; the raw CSVs are git-ignored
and are fetched by `src/download_data.py` at a pinned revision. Values derived
from it and committed here, chiefly the golden answers under `goldens/`, remain
subject to the dataset's CC BY-NC 4.0 terms. If you intend to use the claims
portion of this repository commercially, check that licence first. The
underwriting experiment has no dependency on that dataset.
